      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ECS CPUUtilization (Average & Maximum)",
      "description": "If CPU is pinned near 100% while ThrottledRequests is flat at zero, the ceiling is the 0.25 vCPU task, not DynamoDB \u2014 the pbkdf2 CPU knob or event-loop queueing is the bottleneck, not capacity.",
